# Raw GEO series matrices, downloaded to recover the patient behind each biopsy.
# 23 MB, and scripts/build_patient_map.py --fetch re-downloads them; only the
# small map it distils (data/patients.csv) is worth committing.
artifacts/geo/

# Everything else under artifacts/ IS committed on purpose -- the model, the
# metrics, the demo samples, the split assignment and the honesty numbers are
# all small, and they are what makes the repo demo-able and checkable without
# a 128 MB dataset and a retrain.

